+    /**
+     * DH-011G2 §7/§8: the authoritative native lookup this endpoint's Daher-system search routes
+     * to. Never touches the secondary HAPI store. Zero matches on a genuinely unlinked UUID,
+     * exactly one Patient per the DB-level unique index this patch's migration adds -- more than
+     * one match is a data integrity violation the unique index should make structurally
+     * impossible in committed state, so it fails loudly rather than silently reporting zero or
+     * picking one (§8: never pick first).
