+    /**
+     * DH-011G2 §15: appends the Daher patient-identity identifier to an outgoing FHIR Patient
+     * resource if -- and only if -- a linkage row exists for the native patient being returned.
+     * A patient with no link (created before this migration, or through some path outside the
